flowchart TB
  Chat[Onesa Chat] --> API[Onesa API]
  Travel[Onesa Travel] --> API
  API --> Auth[Authentication and sessions]
  API --> Conversations[Conversation management]
  API --> Agent[Agent runtime]
  API --> RAG[Knowledge and RAG]
  API --> Adapter[Shared model adapter]
  Auth --> PG[(PostgreSQL)]
  Conversations --> PG
  Agent --> PG
  RAG --> PG
  Adapter --> Ollama[Ollama - real Apple M3]
  Adapter --> Mock[Mock - deterministic]
  Adapter -. unverified target .-> VLLM[vLLM - NVIDIA]
  Prep[Dataset preparation] --> Eval[Evaluation framework]
  Prep -. training pending .-> Train[Fine-tuning infrastructure]
  Train -. candidate artifacts .-> Registry[File-based model registry]
  Eval --> Registry
  Registry -. manual reviewed selection .-> Adapter
